<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="yellow">Delusions of Grandeur</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">(DOGMud)</ansi>

A world where belief becomes flesh. You are one of the <ansi fg="yellow">Opened</ansi> — touched by
the Chrysalis, the strange infection that reshapes body and will alike — finding
your footing on the frontier of Gaius.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ What Makes DOGMud Its Own Thing ━━━</ansi>

<ansi fg="white">You become what you do.</ansi>  No classes, no levels. Skills and stats rise through use,
  and the Chrysalis reshapes your very body to match how you live and fight.

<ansi fg="white">The mutation graph.</ansi>  This is the heart of it. Your mutations form a great ring of
  nine <ansi fg="white-bold">clusters</ansi> — Colossus, Ironhide, Ravener, Stalker, Ethereal, Manifester,
  Zealot, Weaver, Trickster — around a generalist Center and a maker's path for
  crafters. You never pick a mutation from a list; the skills you practise <ansi fg="white">drift</ansi>
  you toward a cluster, and you grow into it keystone by keystone, toward a single
  towering <ansi fg="white-bold">apex</ansi> transformation you must earn. Two creatures who fight the same
  monsters can end up utterly different beings. See <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>.

<ansi fg="white">Three pools, not two.</ansi>  Health, Stamina, and Conviction all matter in a fight.

<ansi fg="white">Loot is on the body,</ansi> and <ansi fg="white">death is not deletion</ansi> — falling routes you through
  injury and waking, never a lost character.

